  "description": "One-call logging + OpenTelemetry for ASP.NET Core services: Serilog (console, rolling\n      JSON file, Seq) with a fixed enricher/level convention, OTLP tracing, opt-in metrics,\n      health endpoints, a credential-redaction boundary, and a correlation-scope helper. Every backend is env-gated, so an app\n      with no telemetry stack configured runs unchanged.",
